I created this app to help prepare for my first aerial hoop performance.
I wanted a tool that helped me sync lyrics and portions of a song to specific moves and poses. 
I found that keeping this information in a simple notebook wasn't helping as much as I had hoped.
This tool allowed me to be on the loop, and see the current move on my computer screen, this helped as I was learning my routine.
It also helped me understand how long each move actually took me. 
